        '6.Bc4, a better Sozin than the Najdorf or the Dragon allow, because ...a6 and ...b5 are now a move further away than usual.',
        '6.Be2 and castle short. Against the Najdorf proper this is the dull choice; here it has teeth, since the quiet set-up is backed by the threat of Ndb5.',
