        'Solve the bishop the Tartakower way with ...h6, ...b6 and ...Bb7, which is the modern answer to the opening’s one structural problem.',
        'Insert ...h6 early to ask the g5-bishop its intention before the king has committed, so Black knows whether he is facing Bh4, Bxf6 or a retreat when he chooses where to castle.',
